          "value": "Virulence-associated N-epsilon-fatty acyltransferase that mediates lysine-stearoylation of host Rho GTPase proteins, thereby disrupting the host actin cytoskeleton (PubMed:30061757). Required at the post-invasion stage of Shigella pathogenicity (PubMed:12753186). Contributes to bacterial escape from autophagy (PubMed:15576571)"
        }
