            ],
            "value": "Secreted via type III secretion system (PubMed:12753186). Requires IpgA as a chaperone for its stability and secretion (PubMed:12753186). Localizes on Shigella-containing host vacuoles and modifies its substrates there (PubMed:30061757)"
          }
